# Settings > Apps, a description over the 500-character limit (task C1): Bench Tools (Available) has a ~2000-character
# description (`env HARNESS_APPS_DESC on`, src/harness_apps.cpp); its text page shows the first sentences up to the last
# sentence end that fits in 500 characters with the dots, no "read more" line. Shots: its page, the text at the top and
# at the bottom (the dots, nothing after them), back on the page. Field Notes (installed, ~950 characters) shows the same
# on the Installed side. Review only, no golden.
title settings native apps description cap
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK auto
env HARNESS_APPS catalogue
env HARNESS_APPS_DESC on
env M5APPSTORE_STATE_DIR /nonexistent/harness-appstore
keyboards 1
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 3000
# Available: Bench Tools (~2000 characters)
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 500
key ENTER
wait 500
shot cap_avail_page
expect_rows Description Install Cancel
key ENTER
wait 500
shot cap_avail_text_top
key END
wait 500
shot cap_avail_text_bottom
key ESC
wait 500
key ESC
wait 500
key LEFT
wait 500
# Installed: Field Notes (~950 characters)
key UP
key ENTER
wait 500
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 500
key ENTER
wait 500
shot cap_inst_text_top
key END
wait 500
shot cap_inst_text_bottom
